WEBVTT

s1-season-roster
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:15.910
Back at Lakeside Golf Collective, Riley opens the Summer 2026 season roster. The Blue Heron Flyers carry their regular athletes, Ava Stone and Sam Finch — assigned to this season, so participation always stays with the season.

s2-reserve-pool
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:30.160
Reserves live outside the teams. The season's own men's reserve pool holds Ben Reed — ready to fill in, but excluded from ordinary scheduling until he is officially called on.

s3-substitution
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:49.240
For the Week 3 event, Ava can't play. Riley records a substitution: the event, Ava out, Ben in, plus the reason — one append-only record that names exactly who replaced whom.

s4-roster-intact
00:00:51.640 --> 00:01:06.500
And nothing else moved. Ava is still on the season roster, and Ben is still in the reserve pool — the substitution applies to that one event only, so the season's participation history stays intact.
